  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      <em>Bedroom Dialectics</em> is a personal notebook for observations that don't fit into quick social feeds or formal essays.
    </p>

    <p>
      Pieces jump between English and Bahasa Indonesia, covering whatever feels worth examining closely—from physical infrastructure and historical footnotes to running shoes, public spaces, and late-night habits.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, rendered in static HTML and CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, popups, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New essays are published via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
